'''Volume 1''' is the first volume of the [[Welcome! Pokémon Café: PikaVee's Mixing à la mode]] manga written by {{j|すずきさなえ}} Sanae Suzuki and illustrated by {{j|ふじのきともこ}} Tomoko Fujinoki. It is 32 pages long.

It contains the 11 chapters serialized as (Japanese: '''{{j|ポケモンカフェ　ミックス　ピカブイのくるくる{{ruby|ＤＡＹＳ|デイズ}}}}''' ''Pokémon Café Mix: PikaVee's Spinning DAYS'') and recipes for {{j|ピカチュウのプリンアラモード}} ''Pikachu Fruit Flan'' and {{j|イーブイパンケーキ}} ''Fluffy Eevee Pancakes''.

